# Exotic India Product Creation API (`/vendor-api/product/create`)

Endpoint: `https://www.exoticindia.com/vendor-api/product/create`
Query Parameter: `new_variation=1` (use ONLY when adding new variation(s) to an existing variation-based parent).

---

## 1. New Item with Variations (Initial Publish)

Use when creating a brand-new product that has multiple variations.
- Endpoint: `/vendor-api/product/create` (without `new_variation=1`)
- `item_stock_price[0]`: Parent container (`item_level = "parent"`, empty `color` and `size`).
- `item_stock_price[1..N]`: Variations (`item_level = "variation"`).
- `images.image_directory`: Directory name (e.g., `"saris-2025"`).
- `images.images[0]`: Primary image for the product (e.g. `zzz991-red.jpg`).

```json
{
    "itemcode": "ZZZ991",
    "groupname": "textiles",
    "category": "1162",
    "itemtype": "product",
    "title": "Trial new product",
    "status": 1,
    "optionals": "OPTIONALS_TEXTILES_SARIS",
    "material": "silk",
    "item_stock_price": [
        {
            "size": "",
            "color": "",
            "item_level": "parent",
            "date_added": "2025-12-02",
            "stock_date_added": "2025-12-02",
            "local_stock": 10,
            "price": 40,
            "price_india": 800,
            "gst": 12
        },
        {
            "size": "",
            "color": "red",
            "item_level": "variation",
            "date_added": "2025-12-02",
            "stock_date_added": "2025-12-02",
            "local_stock": 5,
            "price": 40,
            "price_india": 800,
            "gst": 12
        },
        {
            "size": "",
            "color": "blue",
            "item_level": "variation",
            "date_added": "2025-12-02",
            "stock_date_added": "2025-12-02",
            "local_stock": 5,
            "price": 40,
            "price_india": 800,
            "gst": 12
        }
    ],
    "images": {
        "image_directory": "saris-2025",
        "images": [
            "https://domain.com/images/saris/zzz991-red.jpg",
            "https://domain.com/images/saris/zzz991-red_a01.jpg",
            "https://domain.com/images/saris/zzz991-blue.jpg",
            "https://domain.com/images/saris/zzz991-blue_a01.jpg"
        ]
    }
}
```

