## 2. Standalone Item vs Single-Variation Item with Size/Color

- **True Standalone Item (No Size & No Color)**:
  - Endpoint: `/vendor-api/product/create` (without `new_variation=1`)
  - `item_stock_price[0]`: Sole element with `item_level = "standalone"`, `color = ""`, `size = ""`.

- **Single Item with Size or Color**:
  - Standalone products **cannot** have `size` or `color`. If a product has any `size` or `color` specified, a parent container node (`item_level = "parent"`, `size = ""`, `color = ""`) **must** be created at `item_stock_price[0]`, followed by the variation node (`item_level = "variation"`, with `size`/`color`) at `item_stock_price[1]`.

### Standalone Example (No Size, No Color)

```json
{
    "itemcode": "ZZZ992",
    "groupname": "textiles",
    "category": "1162",
    "itemtype": "product",
    "title": "Trial new product",
    "status": 1,
    "optionals": "OPTIONALS_TEXTILES_SARIS",
    "material": "silk",
    "item_stock_price": [
        {
            "size": "",
            "color": "",
            "item_level": "standalone",
            "date_added": "2025-12-02",
            "stock_date_added": "2025-12-02",
            "local_stock": 10,
            "price": 40,
            "price_india": 800,
            "gst": 12
        }
    ],
    "images": {
        "image_directory": "saris-2025",
        "images": [
            "https://domain.com/images/saris/zzz992.jpg",
            "https://domain.com/images/saris/zzz992_a01.jpg",
            "https://domain.com/images/saris/zzz992_a02.jpg"
        ]
    }
}
```

### Single-Variation Item Example (Has Size or Color)

```json
